9505_9", "userAnswer": "Ethnocentrism is the tendency to view one’s own culture, values, and practices as superior and to judge other cultures by those standards.\\n\\nRisk in community development: If project designers are ethnocentric, they may impose solutions that clash with local norms, beliefs, or livelihoods. This can lead to low community participation, resistance, or unintended harm, ultimately reducing the project’s effectiveness and sustainability."}]	247	2026-02-10 16:39:23.431905
