tic of brainrot content?", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "In-depth analysis is focused on providing detailed insights and is not characteristic of brainrot content, which typically favors humor and absurdity over serious discussion.", "correctAnswer": "In-depth analysis"}]	none	2026-03-10 10:12:49.931512	\N
