: "fill_blank", "question": "The digit 6 in the number 6,302 is in the ______ place.", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "In the number 6,302, the digit 6 is in the thousands place, which gives it a value of 6,000.", "correctAnswer": "thousands"}, {"id": "q_1773066896073_7", "type": "short_answer", "question": "What is the value of the digit 5 in the number 15,205?", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "The digit 5 is in the thousands place, so its value is 5,000.", "correctAnswer": "5,000"}, {"id": "q_1773066896073_8", "type": "multiple_choice", "options": ["3.14", "3.15", "3.10", "3.11"], "question": "What is 3.14159 rounded to two decimal places?", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "When rounding 3.14159 to two decimal places, we look at the third decimal place (1). Since it's less than 5, we round down to 3.14.", "correctAnswer": "3.14"}, {"id": "q_1773066896073_9", "type": "true_false", "question": "In the number 2.345, the digit 4 is in the hundredths place.", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "In the decimal number 2.345, the digit 4 is indeed in the hundredths place, which is the second digit to the right of the decimal point.", "correctAnswer": "True"}, {"id": "q_1773066896073_10", "type": "fill_blank", "question": "To round a number to the nearest whole number, we look at the digit in the ______ place.", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "The tenths place is the first digit to the right of the decimal point and determines whether we round up or down.", "correctAnswer": "tenths"}, {"id": "q_1773066896073_11", "type": "short_answer", "question": "What is the result of rounding 9.499 to the nearest whole number?", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "Since the digit in the tenths place is 4, we round down to 9.", "correctAnswer": "9"}, {"id": "q_1773066896073_12", "type": "multiple_choice", "options": ["342", "405", "134", "204"], "question": "Which of the following numbers has a digit in the tens place that represents a value of 40?", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "In the number 405, the digit 4 is in the tens place, which represents a value of 40.", "correctAnswer": "405"}, {"id": "q_1773066896073_13", "type": "true_false", "question": "All digits in a number contribute equally to its overall value.", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "The value of each digit depends on its place value; digits in higher places contribute more to the overall value of the number.", "correctAnswer": "False"}, {"id": "q_1773066896073_14", "type": "fill_blank", "question": "The digit 9 in the number 890,123 is in the ______ place.", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "In the number 890,123, the digit 9 is in the hundred thousands place, which contributes significantly to the overall value.", "correctAnswer": "hundred thousands"}, {"id": "q_1773066896073_15", "type": "short_answer", "question": "If you round 2.75 to the nearest whole number, what do you get?", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "The tenths place digit is 7, which is 5 or more, so we round up to 3.", "correctAnswer": "3"}, {"id": "q_1773066896073_16", "type": "multiple_choice", "options": ["5.5", "5.4", "5.49", "5.0"], "question": "What is the correct rounding of 5.499 to one decimal place?", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "When rounding to one decimal place, the second decimal (9) is 5 or more, so we round up to 5.5.", "correctAnswer": "5.5"}, {"id": "q_1773066896073_17", "type": "true_false", "question": "The digit in the ones place of the number 123.456 is 6.", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "In the number 123.456, the digit in the ones place is 3; 6 is in the thousandths place.", "correctAnswer": "False"}]	313899c9-1f6c-4938-b2d8-9ff12423417e	2026-03-09 14:34:56.20711	\N
