servation, hypothesis formation, experimentation, and drawing conclusions.", "correctAnswer": "To systematically investigate phenomena, acquire new knowledge, or correct and integrate previous knowledge."}, {"id": "q_1773136361424_4", "type": "multiple_choice", "options": ["He don't like apples.", "She go to the store every Tuesday.", "I have seen that movie before.", "They was happy to see us."], "question": "Which of the following sentences is grammatically correct?", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "The sentence 'I have seen that movie before.' is grammatically correct as it uses the present perfect tense appropriately, while the other options contain grammatical errors.", "correctAnswer": "I have seen that movie before."}]	none	2026-03-10 09:52:41.437437	\N
