sing questions about the balance between technology and the human element of football.", "correctAnswer": "VAR technology has introduced a more systematic approach to reviewing key decisions such as goals, penalties, and red cards, aiming to increase accuracy but has led to debates about the flow of the game and subjective interpretations."}, {"id": "q_1773136876732_8", "type": "multiple_choice", "options": ["Cristiano Ronaldo", "Lionel Messi", "Pele", "Gerd Muller"], "question": "Which of the following players holds the record for the most goals scored in a calendar year as of October 2023?", "difficulty": "expert", "explanation": "Lionel Messi set the record for the most goals in a calendar year in 2012, scoring 91 goals, which surpassed Gerd Muller's long-standing record.", "correctAnswer": "Lionel Messi"}, {"id": "q_1773136876732_9", "type": "true_false", "question": "A player can receive a second yellow card in the same match and continue to play if the referee does not show the second yellow card.", "difficulty": "expert", "explanation": "If the referee does not issue a second yellow card, the player may continue to play. However, if the player receives the second yellow card, it results in a red card and ejection from the match.", "correctAnswer": "True"}]	none	2026-03-10 10:01:16.745765	\N
