d 5?", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "The product is found by multiplying the two numbers together. 3 times 5 equals 15.", "correctAnswer": "15"}, {"id": "q_1773214979229_8", "type": "multiple_choice", "options": ["1", "2", "3", "4"], "question": "What is 8 divided by 4?", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "When you divide 8 by 4, you get 2 because 4 goes into 8 exactly two times.", "correctAnswer": "2"}, {"id": "q_1773214979229_9", "type": "true_false", "question": "A triangle has three sides.", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "By definition, a triangle is a polygon with three edges and three vertices.", "correctAnswer": "True"}, {"id": "q_1773214979229_10", "type": "fill_blank", "question": "The number 100 is equal to ___ tens.", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "Since 10 times 10 equals 100, there are 10 tens in 100.", "correctAnswer": "10"}, {"id": "q_1773214979229_11", "type": "short_answer", "question": "What is the area of a rectangle with a length of 5 and a width of 3?", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "The area of a rectangle is calculated by multiplying the length by the width. Thus, 5 times 3 equals 15.", "correctAnswer": "15"}, {"id": "q_1773214979229_12", "type": "multiple_choice", "options": ["10", "20", "5", "15"], "question": "Which is the largest number: 10, 20, 5, or 15?", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "20 is greater than all the other numbers listed.", "correctAnswer": "20"}, {"id": "q_1773214979229_13", "type": "true_false", "question": "All squares are rectangles.", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "A square is a special type of rectangle where all sides are equal, so every square is also a rectangle.", "correctAnswer": "True"}, {"id": "q_1773214979229_14", "type": "fill_blank", "question": "Half of 10 is ___.", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "When you divide 10 by 2, you get 5.", "correctAnswer": "5"}]	none	2026-03-11 07:42:59.569581	\N
