w many sides does a hexagon have?", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "A hexagon is a polygon that has six sides.", "correctAnswer": "6"}, {"id": "q_1773247844701_8", "type": "multiple_choice", "options": ["6", "7", "5", "8"], "question": "What is 10 minus 4?", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "The difference is found by subtracting: 10 - 4 = 6.", "correctAnswer": "6"}, {"id": "q_1773247844701_9", "type": "true_false", "question": "All squares are rectangles.", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "A square is a specific type of rectangle with all sides equal; thus, all squares are indeed rectangles.", "correctAnswer": "True"}]	none	2026-03-11 16:50:44.824649	\N
