uares.", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "While all squares are rectangles (having opposite sides equal), not all rectangles are squares because rectangles can have different side lengths.", "correctAnswer": "False"}, {"id": "q_1773689507012_15", "type": "fill_blank", "question": "The sum of angles in a triangle is ______ degrees.", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "In Euclidean geometry, the sum of the internal angles of a triangle always equals 180 degrees.", "correctAnswer": "180"}, {"id": "q_1773689507012_16", "type": "short_answer", "question": "What is 15 divided by 3?", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "Dividing 15 by 3 gives you 5, which is the quotient of this division problem.", "correctAnswer": "5"}, {"id": "q_1773689507012_17", "type": "multiple_choice", "options": ["7", "8", "9", "10"], "question": "What is the next number in the sequence: 2, 4, 6, ___?", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "This sequence increases by 2 each time. After 6 comes 8.", "correctAnswer": "8"}]	none	2026-03-16 19:31:47.118427	\N
