arly useful in situations where manual input is impractical.", "correctAnswer": "Hands-free operation"}, {"id": "q_1773758441252_5", "type": "multiple_choice", "options": ["Trackball", "Touchpad", "Optical mouse", "Joystick"], "question": "Which input device uses light sensors to detect movement?", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "An optical mouse uses light sensors to detect movement across a surface, translating that movement into cursor movement on the screen.", "correctAnswer": "Optical mouse"}, {"id": "q_1773758441252_6", "type": "true_false", "question": "A graphics tablet is primarily used for typing text into a computer.", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "A graphics tablet is designed for drawing and creating graphics using a stylus, rather than for typing text.", "correctAnswer": "False"}, {"id": "q_1773758441252_7", "type": "fill_blank", "question": "The ________ is an input device that allows users to navigate and interact with a computer using a finger or stylus on a flat surface.", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "A touchpad is commonly found on laptops and allows users to control the cursor by moving their fingers across its surface.", "correctAnswer": "touchpad"}, {"id": "q_1773758441252_8", "type": "short_answer", "question": "What is the main purpose of a microphone as an input device?", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "A microphone converts sound waves into electrical signals, allowing audio input for recording or communication purposes.", "correctAnswer": "To capture sound"}, {"id": "q_1773758441252_9", "type": "multiple_choice", "options": ["Keyboard", "Scanner", "Webcam", "Printer"], "question": "Which of the following input devices is most commonly used for gaming?", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "A keyboard is widely used in gaming for inputting commands and controlling gameplay, while scanners, webcams, and printers are not primarily used for this purpose.", "correctAnswer": "Keyboard"}, {"id": "q_17737584