t is the primary reason for the shape of water molecules?", "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "The shape of water molecules (bent) can be predicted by VSEPR (Valence Shell Electron Pair Repulsion) theory, which states that electron pairs around a central atom will arrange themselves to minimize repulsion.", "correctAnswer": "VSEPR theory"}]	none	2026-03-18 16:21:16.420129	\N
