 the French word for the color blue. It is one of the primary colors that beginners learn.", "correctAnswer": "bleu"}, {"id": "q_1773855753959_7", "type": "short_answer", "question": "What does 'au revoir' mean in English?", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "'Au revoir' is a common way to say goodbye in French. It's important to know both greetings and farewells.", "correctAnswer": "goodbye"}, {"id": "q_1773855753959_8", "type": "multiple_choice", "options": ["livre", "journal", "stylo", "papier"], "question": "Which of the following translates to 'book' in French?", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "'Livre' means 'book' in French. This is a basic vocabulary word useful for students learning the language.", "correctAnswer": "livre"}, {"id": "q_1773855753959_9", "type": "true_false", "question": "In French, 'oui' means 'no'.", "difficulty": "easy", "explanation": "'Oui' means 'yes' in French, while 'non' is the word for 'no'. Understanding these basic affirmations and negations is crucial.", "correctAnswer": "False"}]	none	2026-03-18 17:42:33.97064	\N
