d54c442b-924b-43c5-bf0b-22689f225fc8	\N	module	Week 1: What is AI, How It Can Help You & Using It Safely (Includes ChatGPT demo)	In this lesson, you'll learn:\n- What AI actually is (no tech background needed!)\n- Practical ways AI can save you time as a teacher\n- How to use AI safely and responsibly\n📄 Your notes for this week are attached: you can read them and use them to study. Estimated lesson time: 20–25 minutes.\n\nThis week's task: Try one simple AI prompt on your own. It doesn't need to be school related: just get a feel for it! Come back next week ready to share one thing you noticed.\n\nSuggested tool to try:\n- chat.openai.com\n(free to use)	\N	/api/files//api/files/uploads/ac015e34-ca22-4ce9-adc0-bf32448a5157.pdf	Week1_AI_Class_Notes.pdf	posted	1056f782-7126-475e-81ad-a3fb5993d5d9	2026-03-09 11:07:21.820787	2026-03-10 06:18:51.458	https://vimeo.com/1171726017?share=copy&fl=sv&fe=ci	/api/files/uploads/ac015e34-ca22-4ce9-adc0-bf32448a5157.pdf	\N
b292d396-15c9-4fd0-8c50-239531975399	\N	module	AI Staff Training Module Guide – Hibiscus International Schools	Welcome to your AI Training Programme. This module guide contains everything you need to get started with integrating AI tools into your teaching and administrative practice. Please read through the material before our first session and come prepared with any questions. We look forward to learning and growing together!	\N	/api/files//api/files/uploads/08445248-4705-4b4b-9def-fffbb24b8591.pdf	Hibiscus_Staff_Training_AI (1).pdf	posted	1056f782-7126-475e-81ad-a3fb5993d5d9	2026-03-09 10:56:54.343944	2026-03-10 06:19:16.881	https://vimeo.com/1171724947?share=copy&fl=sv&fe=ci	/api/files/uploads/08445248-4705-4b4b-9def-fffbb24b8591.pdf	\N
d042956d-8bcf-403b-86de-916e389b4653	\N	quiz	Week 2 - Quiz	Introduction to Artificial Intelligence	\N	\N	\N	posted	1056f782-7126-475e-81ad-a3fb5993d5d9	2026-03-10 06:39:11.192036	2026-03-10 06:59:44.521	\N	\N	[{"id": "tq_1773125808164_0", "options": ["Artificial Intelligence", "Automated Interaction", "Advanced Integration", "Artificial Interaction"], "question": "What does AI stand for?", "explanation": "AI stands for Artificial Intelligence, which refers to the simulation of human intelligence in machines.", "correctAnswer": 0}, {"id": "tq_1773125808164_1", "options": ["Grading papers faster", "Replacing teachers", "Limiting student interaction", "Decreasing lesson plans"], "question": "How can AI help teachers in the classroom?", "explanation": "AI can assist in grading papers and providing personalized learning experiences, making teachers' jobs easier.", "correctAnswer": 0}, {"id": "tq_1773125808164_2", "options": ["A social media platform", "An AI language model", "A video editing software", "A gaming console"], "question": "What is ChatGPT?", "explanation": "ChatGPT is an AI language model developed by OpenAI that can generate human-like text based on prompts.", "correctAnswer": 1}, {"id": "tq_1773125808164_3", "options": ["Increased classroom noise", "More personalized learning", "Less student engagement", "Higher teacher workload"], "question": "Which of the following is a benefit of using AI in education?", "explanation": "AI can provide personalized learning experiences that cater to the individual needs of each student.", "correctAnswer": 1}, {"id": "tq_1773125808164_4", "options": ["Privacy and data security", "Increased screen time", "Higher costs", "Complexity of tools"], "question": "What should teachers be aware of when using AI tools?", "explanation": "Teachers should be aware of privacy and data security issues when using AI tools to protect student information.", "correctAnswer": 0}, {"id": "tq_1773125808164_5", "options": ["By providing random topics", "By offering data-driven insights", "By eliminating lesson plans", "By suggesting only one type of learning style"], "question": "How can AI assist in lesson planning?", "explanation": "AI can analyze student performance data to suggest tailored lesson plans that address specific learning needs.", "correctAnswer": 1}, {"id": "tq_1773125808164_6", "options": ["Sharing personal student information", "Using unverified AI applications", "Regularly reviewing AI-generated content", "Ignoring AI limitations"], "question": "Which of the following is a safe practice when using AI in the classroom?", "explanation": "Regularly reviewing AI-generated content helps ensure accuracy and appropriateness for students.", "correctAnswer": 2}, {"id": "tq_1773125808164_7", "options": ["Enhanced creativity", "Bias in AI algorithms", "Improved student-teacher relationships", "More resources for learning"], "question": "What is one potential risk of AI in education?", "explanation": "Bias in AI algorithms can lead to unfair treatment or misunderstandings in educational settings.", "correctAnswer": 1}, {"id": "tq_1773125808164_8", "options": ["Making assessments harder", "Providing instant feedback", "Lowering assessment standards", "Creating confusion"], "question": "What role can AI play in student assessments?", "explanation": "AI can provide instant feedback on assessments, helping students learn from their mistakes more quickly.", "correctAnswer": 1}, {"id": "tq_1773125808164_9", "options": ["ChatGPT", "Excel", "PowerPoint", "Photoshop"], "question": "Which AI tool can help teachers with writing assistance?", "explanation": "ChatGPT can assist teachers and students with writing by generating ideas, correcting grammar, and more.", "correctAnswer": 0}, {"id": "tq_1773125808164_10", "options": ["AI can think like a human", "AI is just a tool", "AI can analyze data", "AI can automate tasks"], "question": "What is a common misconception about AI?", "explanation": "A common misconception is that AI can think like a human, while it operates based on algorithms and data.", "correctAnswer": 0}, {"id": "tq_1773125808164_11", "options": ["By ignoring privacy policies", "By following ethical guidelines", "By using AI without training", "By using all available AI tools"], "question": "How can teachers ensure they are using AI safely?", "explanation": "Following ethical guidelines helps ensure that AI is used responsibly and safely in educational settings.", "correctAnswer": 1}, {"id": "tq_1773125808164_12", "options": ["Feedback is less personalized", "Feedback takes longer to receive", "Feedback can be immediate", "Feedback is less accurate"], "question": "What is a key advantage of using AI for student feedback?", "explanation": "AI can provide immediate feedback, which allows students to address their learning needs in real time.", "correctAnswer": 2}, {"id": "tq_1773125808164_13", "options": ["To ensure they are entertaining", "To check for bias and effectiveness", "To find the cheapest option", "To see if they are trending"], "question": "Why is it important to evaluate AI tools before using them in the classroom?", "explanation": "Evaluating AI tools for bias and effectiveness ensures they are suitable for educational purposes.", "correctAnswer": 1}, {"id": "tq_1773125808164_14", "options": ["Traditional textbooks", "Language learning apps with AI features", "Only classroom lectures", "Group discussions only"], "question": "What is an example of AI being used in language learning?", "explanation": "Language learning apps that use AI can provide personalized lessons and adapt to individual student progress.", "correctAnswer": 1}]
4982bc90-138c-4031-aeda-4400cb25d63b	\N	module	Week 3 - Create a class on studypal	Hello teachers. Let's create a class on studypal. Share the classcode generated and we will give the students your class codes so that they join your classes	\N	\N	\N	posted	1056f782-7126-475e-81ad-a3fb5993d5d9	2026-03-18 06:18:52.032814	2026-03-18 06:25:02.091	https://vimeo.com/1174650586?share=copy&fl=sv&fe=ci	\N	\N
